{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "tr_24",
  "title": "尋跡而行",
  "storyCode": "TR-24",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "040e266a3d0b5b55cd544f87778c4e79894562515135c95a1ed4bd6e38dec674",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cherunder_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡已經完全毀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和羅德島之前的推測一樣，又是一處從城外通向城內的秘密路網。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯就是藉由這些站點，把大量的鋼鐵、晶體單元和巫術裝置運進了倫蒂尼姆，直到修好了碎片大廈，直到造完了飛空艇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這些材料又是怎麼抵達倫蒂尼姆周邊的呢？就算是再愚蠢的公爵也不會允許不被他們掌控的大宗物資在維多利亞境內流通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，恐怕那些東西，也是和食腐者之王的軍團一樣，“唰”一下就出現在了這些站點周邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一直在尋找的所謂“薩卡茲補給線”，恐怕只是真正運輸過程中最後的、最不重要的那個環節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這到底是種什麼技術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一個問題。既然特雷西斯掌握了這種能力，他為什麼不直接把它運用在作戰上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓軍隊直接出現在敵軍防線的後方，或者乾脆讓一批即將引爆的源石炸藥出現在公爵們的座艦頭頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然，這種技術限制很多；要不然……它其實十分脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個巫妖聲稱這是脫離源石技藝範疇的一種法術。可我實在沒辦法想像……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W，你那邊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，沒有戰鬥痕跡，這裡塌得很徹底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……走吧，這裡沒別的好看的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_labentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊內絲，你說羅德島分析了城防軍指揮塔裡的那些資料，他們把目標放在了一個叫“布倫特伍德”的鎮子附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是可露希爾分析出來的，她偷走了自1094年特雷西斯進城以來，所有的貨運資料，生成了一張疊加的路線圖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那張圖上，倫蒂尼姆周邊的所有鎮子都被這些貨運通行記錄佔滿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡畢竟是維多利亞的首都，開戰之前，市民們每天吃的那麼多肉排，喝的那麼多酒，都沒法從貨架上直接長出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，這個鎮子……“布倫特伍德”，卻成了一塊扎眼的空白。通行記錄寥寥，為數不多的幾次記載也大都集中在1094到1095年之間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這很反常，這個鎮子簡直像是被遺忘了。這可是在維多利亞的中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時，羅德島猜測布倫特伍德可能是薩卡茲地下鐵路的起點，或者隱藏路網的樞紐，所以進行了某種暗地裡的通行管制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們剛剛證明了這種運輸站確實存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但，我們已經知道特雷西斯有一雙，哼，“無形的大手”，能憑空把東西擺放在任意位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可能需要重新考慮布倫特伍德的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離這裡越近的地方，血魔那些法陣出現得就越密集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而最遠端的幾個點，把它們和布倫特伍德連線，距離也大致相等。我們可以猜測，這個距離就是投放的極限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別猜了，我知道那個叫布倫特伍德的鎮子，窮得叮噹響，什麼都藏不住。幾個月前我去那裡的時候，甚至都沒幾個晃蕩的薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商隊不經過那裡，說不定是因為太沒意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出發吧，既然沒有更多線索，交給偶然也是不錯的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一個地點就選擇這裡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "40_g6_mountaincave"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "40_g6_mountaincave"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你大概真的猜對了，這裡的影子很不尋常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我該說是混亂嗎？不過，似乎也有跡可循。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像是……有一艘船在其中行駛，激起的波紋相互重疊，相互干涉，最終把一切攪得一團亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與其說是行駛，更像是……漂流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“漂流”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾聽某位垂暮的炎魔老人說起過一段故事，在他那些破碎的囈語中，也提到了這個詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼故事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "災難故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望一會兒出現在我們眼前的，不會是故事裡的那種東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望我們的好運還沒用完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "覺得自己有好運的傭兵都死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，W，作為萬全準備中的一環，你留在這裡接應我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次我們的任務不是戰鬥，我們首先要弄清楚自己正在面對什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果情況變差，我們需要撤出，你就……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我不會給你們留門的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會精心設計好引爆角度，等你們被血魔或者食腐者，或者乾脆特雷西斯本人追到了洞口，眼見光明就在眼前，然後——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "轟隆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就能變成你最愛的那些故事裡的人物啦，赫德雷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一個人對付不了特蕾西婭，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊內絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的會把你們埋在這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哼。你自己明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W真的會把整座山都炸塌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又不是不知道她有多瘋，何必用特蕾西婭刺激她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她那副裝出來的樣子真是可悲。我寧願她知道自己到底要的是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你待在城裡那麼久，她要是只想弄清真相，直接問你不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她有問過你“那個特蕾西婭到底是真是假”之類的問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她也從沒問過我。看吧，她的心智毫無長進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然，向那個“特蕾西婭”搖尾乞憐，懇求她的原諒；要不然，就做好準備殺了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她擺出這副模樣來算是什麼？試圖向我們表現出她很好她很堅強？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是試圖說服她自己，什麼事情都沒有發生，她只要和以前一樣殺人和埋地雷，一切事情就都能過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W如果真的有本事什麼都不想，那也可以。可她……就像是個站在冰面上的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拖拖拉拉地不知道要不要探出腳去，往前走幾步卻又退回來，然後站在原地瞻前顧後，徒勞地感傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可沒看出來這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……少騙人，你只是不願意惹麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來你這麼關心她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是在關心我自己，我不想讓她害死我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說真的，伊內絲，你要不要考慮回卡茲戴爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈！覺得我拖累你們的大計劃了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我只是偶爾會想，我和W都有理由繼續留在這片戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……也有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g5_spinestops"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡就是……山體的內部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們挖空了整座山？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這下W的爆破計劃要更順利了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些軌道，還有這個規模的裝卸結構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是個大傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下一輪是什麼時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它永遠準時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我該向長官打個報告的，我寧願去外面殺維多利亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會打仗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用你提醒！只是這裡……實在太壓抑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我每天都能看到那些幻象，那些真真假假的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡簡直像是……一個漩渦，不停地冒出那些跨時空垃圾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好，厄爾蘇拉是個好人，她不會動不動就找我們的麻煩，想盡辦法在我們頭上撒野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說，按照軍事委員會的級別來看，她是最年輕的少校？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她不是王庭的成員。她走不長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西婭殿下和攝政王也不是什麼血統純正的魔族佬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿，王庭，王庭又怎麼樣！卡茲戴爾是這些抱團取暖的大家長們爭取來的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他們都是最厲害的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是因為……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，時間快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寡言的薩卡茲勞工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去機器旁邊等著，準備裝貨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g5_spinestops"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你聽到他們說的那個名字了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厄爾蘇拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會不會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未必是我們想的那個人。普通薩卡茲的名字要不就只是個代號，要不就是從那些英雄故事裡摘出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竊取時間的厄爾蘇拉，鎖與鑰匙的厄爾蘇拉。這是個關於巨獸的薩卡茲傳說，誰拿去用都不稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……慢著。竊取時間的……厄爾蘇拉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“赫德雷”，那你的名字有什麼說法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是鐘聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你看那邊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是，什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g4_spinestops_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……“運輸船”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個大小……特雷西斯還藏著這種……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然，真的是這樣……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竊取時間的……厄爾蘇拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很巧合吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在厄爾蘇拉的傳說裡，有一隻能讓人眼前萬物減緩，從迷霧中窺探過去的巨獸，襲擊了卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後，英雄厄爾蘇拉穿過了無數的過去，打撈起了那些迷失在時空幻覺之中的同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰知道，隨便取了這個名字的我，卻有這麼一天能真的目睹這個傳說呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的角磨得越來越像樣了，伊內絲。我真會以為你是個徹頭徹尾的薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厄爾蘇拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷，你可忍心辜負曼弗雷德將軍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽來那些小道消息的時候，我就知道你不會對伊內絲下手。可我工作的保密性質讓我始終不能親自去倫蒂尼姆看看你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你不是疤痕商場欽點的下一代掌門人嗎？可聽上去，你早就是這裡的骸骨司機了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能扮演傳說裡的英雄，讓你這麼積極賣命嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古舊的事物已經沒那麼吸引人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有念舊的蠢貨還在繼續用這個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以幫自己再改一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那千里迢迢來敘舊的老朋友們，怎麼找得到我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣，要不要一起喝點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得你以前滴酒不沾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前啊……以前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄爾蘇拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以前也不會對我揮刀，伊內絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
